- Codecademy: This interactive platform offers courses in web development, including HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
- Udemy: This online learning marketplace has a wide selection of courses on web development topics, including advanced HTML and CSS.
- Mozilla Developer Network: This resource provides documentation and tutorials on web development, including advanced HTML and CSS techniques.
- GitHub: This code hosting platform is home to many open-source projects that you can study and learn from.
