<|user|>
What are some common challenges in deep learning?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Some common challenges in deep learning include overfitting, vanishing gradients, exploding gradients, selecting appropriate model architecture, choosing hyperparameters, and working with large amounts of data. Overfitting occurs when a model becomes too complex and begins to fit the noise in the training data rather than the underlying patterns. Gradient problems occur when the gradients become too small or too large, making it difficult to train the model effectively. <|endoftext|>
