<|asst|>
Sure, here are a few examples:
1. "To hit it big"
2. "To strike gold"
3. "To be on top of the world"
4. "To make a killing"
5. "To come out on top"
6. "To hit the jackpot"
7. "To be a roaring success"
8. "To be in the black"
