const xml = `
xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?
The Renewable Energy Crisis
John Smith
Renewable energy has faced challenges such as high production costs and intermittency, but there is evidence of progress and potential for renewable energy to meet future energy needs with continued investment and innovation. However, there are also concerns about the environmental impacts and scalability of renewable energy technologies.
The Future of Electric Cars
Jane Doe
Electric cars have been gaining popularity due to their lower emissions and fuel costs, but there are still challenges to overcome such as limited range and the need for more charging infrastructure. Despite these challenges, many believe that electric cars will play a large role in the future of transportation.
`;

const parser = new DOMParser();
const xmlDoc = parser.parseFromString(xml,"text/xml");

const title = xmlDoc.getElementsByTagName("title")[0].childNodes[0].nodeValue;
const author = xmlDoc.getElementsByTagName("author")[0].childNodes[0].nodeValue;

console.log("Title: " + title);
console.log("Author: " + author);
```

