Sure, here's a sample HTML code for the webpage with the requirements you mentioned:
```

My Simple Webpage

 body {
 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
 margin: 0;
 padding: 0;
 }
 header {
 background-color: #333;
 color: #fff;
 padding: 10px;
 }
 nav {
 display: inline-block;
 }
 nav a {
 color: #fff;
 text-decoration: none;
 padding: 10px;
 }
 nav a:hover {
 background-color: #555;
 }
 section {
 margin: 20px;
 }
 .featured-image {
 display: flex;
 flex-direction: column;
 align-items: center;
 margin-bottom: 20px;
 }
 .featured-image img {
 max-width: 100%;
 height: auto;
 }
 .featured-image p {
 font-style: italic;
 margin-top: 10px;
 text-align: center;
 }
 .item {
 display: flex;
 flex-direction: row;
 margin-bottom: 20px;
 }
 .item img {
 max-width: 30%;
 margin-right: 20px;
 }
 .item p {
 margin: 0;
 }
 footer {
 background-color: #333;
 color: #fff;
 padding: 10px;
 display: flex;
 flex-direction: row;
 align-items: center;
 justify-content: space-between;
 }
 .social-media {
 display: flex;
 flex-direction: row;
 align-items: center;
 }
 .social-media a {
 color: #fff;
 margin-right: 10px;
 }
 


