How can I generate a table that displays the attributes and significance of Hindu goddesses with columns for name, attributes, and significance? Can you also provide a formula to sort the table alphabetically by name? Lastly, what are some recommended books or resources to learn more about these goddesses? 
[formula]
begin{table}
centering
begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|}
hline
textbf{Name} & textbf{Attributes} & textbf{Significance}  hline
Durga & Warrior goddess, protective mother, slayer of demons & Celebrated during Navratri, represents victory of good over evil  hline
Lakshmi & Goddess of wealth, prosperity, and fortune & Celebrated during Diwali, represents material and spiritual wealth  hline
Saraswati & Goddess of knowledge, music, and art & Represents the pursuit of knowledge and the arts  hline
end{tabular}
end{table}
[formula]
To sort the table alphabetically by name, use the following formula: 
[formula]
SELECT * FROM table_name ORDER BY name ASC;
For further learning about these goddesses, some recommended books are "Hindu Goddesses: Vision of the Divine Feminine in the Hindu Religious Traditions" by David R. Kinsley and "The Book of Goddesses and Heroines" by Patricia Monaghan. Additionally, websites like Hinduism Today and the Encyclopedia of Hinduism can provide further information.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any other questions. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
Thank you for the recommendations! I'm curious about the role of goddesses in Hinduism. How do they fit into the overall belief system and worship practices?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
In Hinduism, goddesses play an important role alongside male deities. They are considered to be manifestations of the divine feminine energy, or Shakti, and represent various aspects of the universe such as creation, destruction, and preservation. Worship of goddesses is often associated with fertility, protection, and nurturing.

In terms of worship practices, many Hindus offer prayers, offerings, and perform rituals to honor the goddesses. Some popular goddess festivals include Navratri, Durga Puja, and Kali Puja. Different regions and communities may have their own unique ways of worshiping specific goddesses as well.

Is there anything else you would like me to clarify about this topic? <|endoftext|>
<|end|>


