To determine the top 5 organizations with the highest percentage of refugees served, we would need access to data on the number of refugees served by each organization. Unfortunately, this information is not readily available. However, some organizations that are known for providing assistance to refugees in the US include the International Rescue Committee, Catholic Charities, and the United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR). <|endoftext|>
