Assuming that the first row of the table is a header row, this formula calculates the average temperature in the range B2:B32, <|fim_suf|>, there are several ways to visualize the temperature data in the table using Excel. One option is to create a line chart that shows the trend of the temperatures over time. Here's how you can do it:

