2. Go to the "Insert" tab on the ribbon and select "Line Chart".
3. Choose a chart style that you like, such as a basic line chart.
4. You should now see a chart that displays the temperature trend over time.

You can customize the chart further by adding axis labels, changing the colors, or adjusting the formatting. <|endoftext|>
