2. John Maynard Keynes: He was an economist who played a significant role in shaping economic policies during the Great Depression. His ideas about government intervention in the economy and the use of fiscal policy to stabilize economic fluctuations have influenced economic policies worldwide. His contributions to economics have had a significant impact on the global economy. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
