 b. Otherwise, reset "vowel_count" to 1 and update "last_vowel" to the current vowel
 3. Otherwise, set "last_vowel" to the current vowel
 ii. Otherwise, reset "vowel_count" to 0 and set "last_vowel" to null
3. Return the value of "index" <|endoftext|>
