<|user|>
How does urbanness affect people's mental health?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Studies have shown that urbanness can have both positive and negative effects on mental health. On one hand, the stimulation and excitement of city life can be invigorating and lead to feelings of happiness and satisfaction. On the other hand, the noise, pollution, and stress of daily life in the city can also contribute to anxiety, depression, and other mental health issues. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
