She tried to save up by working extra jobs, but it was never enough. However, one day, a fairy godmother appeared before her and granted her wish to attend the ball. The girl was overjoyed and wore the most beautiful dress she could find.

As she arrived at the ball, she caught the eye of the prince who was instantly mesmerized by her beauty. They danced the night away and fell in love.

The next day, the prince came to the girl's humble abode and asked for her hand in marriage. She accepted, and they lived happily ever after. The girl never forgot the kindness of the fairy godmother who made her dreams come true, and she spent the rest of her life helping those in need, just as she had been helped. <|endoftext|>
