Machine learning is a type of artificial intelligence that uses algorithms to analyze data and find patterns, allowing computers to learn and make predictions or decisions without being explicitly programmed to do so. It has many applications in real-world settings such as personalized recommendations, fraud detection, speech recognition, and image classification. By continually learning from new data, machine learning models can become more accurate and effective over time. <|endoftext|>
