date_last_updated_list = re.findall(r'Date Last Updated: (d{2}/d{2}/d{4})', page_text)
```
2. Modify step 6 to include the new data points in the XML document:
```
for i in range(len(item_code_list)):
 item = ET.SubElement(root, 'item')
 code = ET.SubElement(item, 'code')
 code.text = item_code_list[i]
 quantity = ET.SubElement(item, 'quantity')
 quantity.text = quantity_list[i]
 description = ET.SubElement(item, 'description')
 description.text = item_description_list[i]
 date = ET.SubElement(item, 'date_last_updated')
 date.text = date_last_updated_list[i]
```
This should give you an XML document with all four data points for each item in the inventory list. <|endoftext|>
