I challenge you to unravel the mysteries hidden in Poem A and Poem B using your analytical skills. Apply the L=S+V+O+C formula to dissect the language, structure, and tone of both poems. Your task is to furnish me with a thorough evaluation of the linguistic, structural, and tonal elements of these poems, so I can perform a comparative analysis. Can you unlock the secrets of these literary works?
