Another option could be a pie chart, as shown below:

![Concert Attendance Pie Chart](https://i.imgur.com/tJdOHVT.png)

In this chart, each slice of the pie represents a different concert, and the size of the slice represents the proportion of attendees compared to the total number of attendees across all concerts. This chart is useful for seeing how each concert contributed to the overall attendance. <|endoftext|>
