- Lisbon, Portugal: Lisbon is a charming coastal city with colorful buildings and a lively atmosphere. Couples can explore the Alfama neighborhood, take a tram tour, visit the historic Belem Tower, or even take a day trip to nearby Sintra to see the fairytale-like castles. <|endoftext|>
