- The rise of the dinosaurs
- The evolution of mammals
- Human evolution

VI. Applications of Evolutionary Theory
- Medicine and genetics
- Agriculture and pest management
- Conservation biology
- The social implications of evolutionary theory

VII. Controversies and Challenges to Evolutionary Theory
- Creationism and Intelligent Design
- Misconceptions about evolution
- The role of religion in understanding evolution

