There are many educational games that can be adapted for video chat! One option is "Kahoot," which is a quiz-style game where players answer multiple-choice questions on various topics. You can create your own quizzes or use ones that are already available on the platform. Another option is "Boggle," which helps improve vocabulary and spelling skills while also being fun to play. In this game, players have to find as many words as possible from a grid of letters within a set amount of time. <|endoftext|>
