Based on their shared interests, one unique anniversary gift idea could be a personalized travel map where they can mark the places they've been together and plan future trips. Another idea could be booking them a taste test experience or cooking class featuring the cuisine of one of the countries they've visited. For their adventurous side, you could gift them a hiking trip or an adventure experience such as hot air balloon ride or bungee jumping. Additionally, if they tend to go to a lot of concerts, you could consider getting them VIP passes to see one of their favorite bands perform live. These are just a few ideas tailored to their interests and experiences. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
Thank you for those ideas! What about something more sentimental or romantic? They're a very affectionate couple and I want to get them something that speaks to their love for each other.
<|end|>
