In this code, a prepared statement is created using the Prepare method of the database object, which allows us to reuse the same SQL statement with different parameter values. The leaders array contains the names of the leaders we want to retrieve the nationalities for. We loop over this array and execute the prepared statement for each leader by calling the QueryRow method with the current leader name as the parameter value. The Scan method is used to scan the result of the query into the nationality variable. Finally, we print the leader name and nationality using the fmt package. <|endoftext|>
