Serena is a dynamic, versatile, innovative, tenacious, empathetic, and cultured individual with a wealth of experience across diverse industries, including finance, technology, and media. She is a modern-day Leonardo da Vinci, with a diverse skill set and a passion for learning that drives her to excel in every field she enters.
