2. Put on - to wear, add clothing / Take off - to remove clothing
3. Set up - to establish, create / Close down - to shut, end
4. Take in - to understand, comprehend / Give out - to distribute, emit
5. Look up - to search for, find information / Look down - to show disdain, look with disapproval. <|endoftext|>
