 echo $sentence->text . "  
";
 }
}
```
This code uses the regular expression `/(terrible|hate|boring|can't stand|annoying)/i` to match any sentence that contains one of the negative words or phrases. The `i` modifier makes the regular expression case-insensitive.
You can add more negative words or phrases to the regular expression as needed. <|endoftext|>
