Sure, here's the MATLAB code to generate a heat map of the park location:
```matlab
% Define data points
lat = [37.7749, 37.7750, 37.7751, 37.7752, 37.7753, 37.7754];
lon = [-122.4194, -122.4193, -122.4192, -122.4191, -122.4190, -122.4189];
temp = [68, 72, 74, 75, 73, 70];
% Create scatter plot with temperature as color
scatter(lon, lat, 50, temp, 'filled');
colorbar;
xlabel('Longitude');
ylabel('Latitude');
title('Heat Map of Park Location');
```
