| ID | Socio-Economic Background | Age Range | Gender | Number of Participants |
|----|---------------------------|-----------|--------|-----------------------|
| 1 | High | 20-30 | Male | 55 |
| 2 | Medium | 30-40 | Female | 42 |
| 3 | Low | 40-50 | Male | 18 |
| 4 | High | 20-30 | Female | 61 |
| 5 | Medium | 50-60 | Male | 35 |
| 6 | Low | 30-40 | Female | 23 |
