Why is climate change occurring?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Climate change is occurring primarily due to human activities, such as burning fossil fuels for energy, deforestation, and industrial processes. These activities release large amounts of greenhouse gases into the atmosphere, trapping heat and causing global temperatures to rise. This leads to a range of impacts, including sea level rise, more intense storms, and changes in precipitation patterns. <|endoftext|>
