```
Set 1: Challenge Champion Chronic 
Set 2: Developer Denim Disaster 
Set 3: Example Elephant Elite 
Set 4: Gadget 
```
As you can see, each set contains words that share a common characteristic that is different from the previous set. <|endoftext|>
