<|end|>
<|user|>
Speaking of snacks, what are some other popular snacks in India, apart from the ones you just mentioned?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
India is known for its diverse cuisine, and there are countless snacks that one can try here. Some of the popular ones include Samosas, Kachoris, Vada Pav, Chaat, Dosa, and Idli. These snacks vary in taste and preparation method depending on the region they are from. For example, Samosas are originally from North India, while Dosa and Idli are from South India. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>


