Data:
1 | John | 75000.00
2 | Sarah | 80000.00
3 | Mike | 65000.00
4 | Emily | 90000.00
5 | David | 82000.00
6 | Amy | 70000.00
7 | Adam | 75000.00
8 | Lisa | 85000.00
9 | Brian | 78000.00
10 | Jane | 95000.00
Please provide the SQL code and the resulting output.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
The SQL query to retrieve the top 5 highest paid employees in the company would be:
```SQL
SELECT name, salary 
FROM employees 
ORDER BY salary DESC 
LIMIT 5;
```
The resulting output would be:
```
name | salary
-------|--------
Jane | 95000.0
Emily | 90000.0
Lisa | 85000.0
David | 82000.0
Sarah | 80000.0
``` <|endoftext|>
