Can you tell me more about the history of zodiac signs and how they came to be associated with symbols?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
The history of zodiac signs can be traced back to ancient Babylonian astronomy, where a set of constellations were used as markers for the 12 months of the year. These constellations were later adopted by the Greeks, who assigned each one an animal symbol based on their myths and legends. This is how the zodiac signs as we know them today came to be associated with symbols. <|endoftext|>
