<|asst|>
To generate a circular shape with a gradient effect that goes from the outer edges to the center with a red hue in CSS, you can use the following code:
```
.circle {
 width: 200px;
 height: 200px;
 border-radius: 50%;
 background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #ff0000 0%, #ffffff 100%);
}
```
To add a hover effect that smoothly transitions the shade of red, you can use the following code:
```
.circle:hover {
 background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #ff0000 0%, #ffffff 100%);
 transition: background 0.5s ease;
}
```
To implement this using Go code, you can use the code you provided to generate the CSS code for the circle, and then add the hover effect using the following code:
```
