<|asst|>
To add a new classification for animals with specialized digestive systems, you can modify the Animal struct to include a new field for this category:
```
type Animal struct {
 Name string
 Classification string
 DigestiveSystem string
 Specialized string
}
```
Then, you can add two new animals to the animals slice with this new classification:
```
animals := []Animal{
 {Name: "Lion", Classification: "Mammal", DigestiveSystem: "Carnivore"},
 {Name: "Elephant", Classification: "Mammal", DigestiveSystem: "Herbivore"},
 {Name: "Python", Classification: "Reptile", DigestiveSystem: "Carnivore"},
