```
breeds = {'Poodle', 'Labrador', 'Chihuahua', 'Bulldog', 'Dachshund', 'Golden Retriever', 'Rottweiler'};
```
You can do the same for the `sizes` and `behaviors` cell arrays. Just make sure to update the maximum index used by `randi()` accordingly. <|endoftext|>
