Communication style: Tom is a good listener and is always willing to lend an ear to someone in need. He is also very articulate and can express his thoughts and feelings well.
Distinctive habits: Tom has a habit of tapping his foot when he's deep in thought. He also tends to bite his nails when he's nervous or stressed.
Medical Conditions and Allergies
--------------------------------
Tom has a mild allergy to peanuts and has to be careful when eating foods that may contain them. He also has asthma, which he manages with an inhaler.
Past Experiences
----------------
Tom grew up in a small town and was very close to his family. He was bullied in middle school, which led to some self-esteem issues that he has since worked through. He is now a confident and outgoing young adult.
Summary
-------
Tom is a slim young adult with wavy brown hair and blue eyes. He has a tendency to fidget when he's nervous, but is a good listener and can express his thoughts and feelings well. He has a mild peanut allergy and asthma, but doesn't let these conditions hold him back. His past experiences have shaped him into a confident and outgoing young adult.


